C-Dirt 3.0 Release Notes :
================================================================

Bug fixes to clone bouncing people and objects around
In-line help command, eliminates silly "pfilter"
New bootstrap loader (faster) loads zones directly into game
Saves wiz zones as regular text files
Miscellaneous bug fixes to io, and new/better update system
New flag system which makes adding flags or flagsets easy
New pflags booter, makes adding levels easier

C-Dirt 2.4 Release Notes :
================================================================

BUG FIXES! BUG FIXES! BUG FIXES!
Newer aberchat
Improved looting commands
64-bit Mflags
Some zones removed (but it's a good thing that they are...)
Smarter mobiles (will equip only when they find a better weapon)
Should work with RedHat and other linuxes out of the box
Make distro for people who want to re-distribute cdirt

